## Several quantities

`measurement_text` selects the target. Use support only to recover its unit and context. Do not add doses, assay concentrations, times, comparator values, or related outcomes.

If multiple same-unit endpoint outcomes remain and the row does not select one, return `unsure`. If clearly labelled outcomes measure the same canonical endpoint in different units, return each in source order. Omit an unresolved quantity without discarding another clearly resolved endpoint quantity.
